# issue #46 gadgets batch 3 (bsrl-sim), a diff on top of the other patches (the whole chain, after hyper_unmodelled.patch).
# gadget.c: NEXT kind (next_attack_change, type 23; published STATUS). The accessory getter 0xb422c8 (mov x0, xzr; ret in
# this client build) is replaced by acc_of_char (player(ch) +0x190), so the skill tick arms a pending modifier (+0x3c ->
# +0x54) and libg's attack code runs its own SubType branch; hook_enter on the "modifier used" stub 0xb27cfc clears it;
# hook_enter on 0xb78c28 puts SubType 2 / 33's StatusEffectEnemy on the shot's hit struct (+0xd0); gadget_root_post
# (called from env.c my_root) applies the hit struct's server-only fields (11 sleep, 10 ammo sink; 3 stun and 29 lifesteal
# coded, their rows masked). A pending modifier is dropped after NEXT_IDLE ticks armed with no consume or NEXT_TIMEOUT
# unarmed. GadImpl.ready: no fire while not ready (published cooldown >= 1). Skill gadgets' cooldown: the accessory's,
# else the skill's BonusSkillCooldown (0xb0d878), else its Cooldown (ms / 50). Six more rows in g_masked. NB_GAD_NEXT=0
# turns the kind off, NB_GAD_DBG=1 logs it. env.c: the gadget_root_post call, gadget_install after gear_install.
# superfix_cc.c: superfix_cc_stun returns whether the stun was applied (one definition for superfix_moves.c and gadget.c).
# Batch 2: gadget_self.c (new): the SELF kinds (published STATUS, Hank's / Lou's SHIELD): statuses put in superfix's store
# through 0xb35dd0 (the card's own row, or synthetic StatusEffectData for Hank / Lou / Willow / Kit / Juju / Moe /
# Bonnie's reload / Sandy), Draco's Last Stand and Trunk's ReceiveDamageInversion (gadget_root_pre, called from env.c
# my_root before libg's root), CancelOnDamage of the gadget statuses and Surge's 2 ammo (gself_root_post), Sandy's sleep
# (LoseControl, full heal at the wake, woken by damage), Tara's / Buzz's bush vision (gadget_vision, read by env.c's bush
# hiding). gadget.c: HEAL SubType 4 (Meg, only in her mech) and ConsumesAmmo (Byron, 0x123f7c0 through 0xcf6a08), AREA
# heal SubType 6 (Buster), BUOY (Buzz's Reserve Buoy, SUPER), Kenji's percent / window swapped (CustomValue2 % over
# CustomValue1 ticks), the SELF entries. env.c: gadget_root_pre / gadget_vision weak calls, env_ground (bush / water).
# superfix_status.c: superfix_status_charge_pct adds the statuses' UltiChargeBoostPercent (+0xc4); superfix_status_live.
# build.sh: gadget_self.c. NB_GAD_SELF=0 turns the SELF kinds off. superfix_moves.c: the grapple asks gadget_buoy_nostun
# (gadget.c) when a torpedo ends; the first one after a Reserve Buoy lands without the stun.
# Review fixes: gadget_clear also at env.c env_on_build (the old battle's accessories are freed before its intro ticks run
# gadget_tick); acc_of_char only for the player's own brawler with a NEXT gadget (else NULL, as the stub); a NEXT modifier
# dropped when its brawler dies or changes; next_hit_tick (-1 at reset) only from a real consume; Sandy's wake lowers the
# stun ticks by the sleep's own only; the NEXT counters zeroed per battle; gadget_ready_refresh before gadget_publish (the
# readiness of the response's state); gadget_root_pre after env.c's just_popped / respawn checks, not for storm damage;
# skill gadgets with MaxCharge > 1 (Shelly, Colette) fire that many times per cooldown; Willow's dive without
# invisibility; FishTank_Slow masked; the skill Cooldown fallback read as ms; Byron's readiness counts his attacks still
# queued for the next step start (env.c env_pending_attacks). Notes: notes/issue46.md. Paths relative to engine/.
